# Project Rules

- This is a TypeScript Next.js web app that wraps an existing Send-to-Kindle CLI.
- Prefer small, focused changes.
- Do not rewrite working logic unless necessary.
- Preserve existing CLI behavior while extracting reusable services.
- Before coding, inspect relevant files.
- After coding, explain what changed and how to test it.
- Use clear error handling and typed return values.
